  "prefLabel": "Env-A 202.06 Public Hearing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 202.06 Public Hearing.\n\n(a) The department shall schedule and hold a public hearing on the petition no sooner than 30 days following the public notice required by Env-A 202.05.\n\n(b) The hearing shall be conducted as a non-adjudicative proceeding in accordance with Env-C 205 and Env-A 203.\n\nSource. #8128, eff 7-28-04; ss by #10187, eff 9-25-12 (from Env-A 202.05); ss by #13491, eff 11-19-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a200.html"
